  <entry>
    <title>排版与组件指南</title>
    <url>/2026/10/17/%E6%8E%92%E7%89%88%E4%B8%8E%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>这篇是自用的排版速查。所有样式都由主题的 <code>miku.css</code> 提供，写文章时不需要写任何 HTML。</p>
<h2 id="标题"><a href="#标题" class="headerlink" title="标题"></a>标题</h2><p>正文里用 <code>##</code> 和 <code>###</code> 就够了。<code>##</code> 是带发光竖线的标题，会进右侧目录；<code>###</code> 是青绿色小标题。</p>
<h3 id="这是三级标题"><a href="#这是三级标题" class="headerlink" title="这是三级标题"></a>这是三级标题</h3><h4 id="这是四级标题（樱花粉）"><a href="#这是四级标题（樱花粉）" class="headerlink" title="这是四级标题（樱花粉）"></a>这是四级标题（樱花粉）</h4><h2 id="列表"><a href="#列表" class="headerlink" title="列表"></a>列表</h2><p>无序列表：</p>
<ul>
<li>第一个</li>
<li>第二个，稍微长一点，看看换行之后的间距是否舒服</li>
<li>第三个</li>
</ul>
<p>有序列表：</p>
<ol>
<li>先做这个</li>
<li>再做那个</li>
<li>最后收尾</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="引用"><a href="#引用" class="headerlink" title="引用"></a>引用</h2><blockquote>
<p>世界は、まだまだこれから。</p>
<p>世界才刚刚开始。</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="提示块"><a href="#提示块" class="headerlink" title="提示块"></a>提示块</h2><p>Butterfly 的 <code>note</code> 标签，四种颜色够用了。</p>
<div class="note tip flat"><p>小技巧</p>
<p>提示块里可以放<strong>行内样式</strong>、<code>代码</code>，以及<a href="/about/">链接</a>。</p>
</div>

<div class="note info flat"><p>说明</p>
<p><code>info</code> 是默认的青绿色。</p>
</div>

<div class="note warning flat"><p>注意</p>
<p><code>warning</code> 用来写需要小心的事情。</p>
</div>

<div class="note danger flat"><p>彩蛋</p>
<p>其实 <code>danger</code> 也能很可爱。</p>
</div>

<h2 id="表格"><a href="#表格" class="headerlink" title="表格"></a>表格</h2><table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>元素</th>
<th>颜色</th>
<th>用途</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>主色</td>
<td><code>#39C5BB</code></td>
<td>链接、按钮、强调</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>辅色</td>
<td><code>#FF7FAE</code></td>
<td>悬停、渐变末端</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>底色</td>
<td><code>#05090F</code></td>
<td>深色页面背景</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>正文</td>
<td><code>#E9F7F6</code></td>
<td>文字</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<h2 id="代码"><a href="#代码" class="headerlink" title="代码"></a>代码</h2><p>行内代码：<code>const miku = &#39;#39C5BB&#39;</code>。</p>
<p>带语言标记的代码块会自动套用 darker 主题：</p>
<figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 主题色常量</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">const</span> <span class="variable constant_">MIKU</span> = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">teal</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;#39C5BB&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">pink</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;#FF7FAE&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">night</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;#05090F&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">glow</span>(<span class="params">color, strength = <span class="number">0.45</span></span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="string">`0 0 32px -6px <span class="subst">$&#123;color&#125;</span>`</span> <span class="comment">// 发光阴影</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">export</span> <span class="keyword">default</span> <span class="title function_">glow</span>(<span class="variable constant_">MIKU</span>.<span class="property">teal</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 构建 + 本地预览</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo server --port 4000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">leek</span>(<span class="params">n=<span class="number">39</span></span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&quot;&quot;&quot;甩葱&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="string">&quot;葱&quot;</span> * n</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(leek())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;site&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;xxybg&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;theme&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;butterfly&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;skin&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;miku-neon&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;color&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;#39C5BB&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;posts&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="number">4</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<h2 id="分隔线"><a href="#分隔线" class="headerlink" title="分隔线"></a>分隔线</h2><p>下面这条线是主题自带的音符分隔线。</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="图片"><a href="#图片" class="headerlink" title="图片"></a>图片</h2><p>图片会自动圆角、加描边、居中。</p>
<p><img src="/img/cover-2.jpg" alt="初音主题的封面素材"></p>
<h2 id="收尾"><a href="#收尾" class="headerlink" title="收尾"></a>收尾</h2><p>写完了。回到 <a href="/">首页</a> 看看效果。</p>
]]></content>
